{'symbol': 'NRG', 'date': '2023-03-24 09:00:00', 'title': 'NRG AND THE CITY OF HOUSTON JOIN FORCES TO PLANT 100,000 TREES ACROSS THE CITY', 'text': "HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--NRG ENERGY INC. (NYSE:NRG)— TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS WORKING WITH THE CITY OF HOUSTON AND TREES FOR HOUSTON TO PLANT 100,000 TREES AT SITES ACROSS THE CITY. SUPPORTING THE CITY'S ESTABLISHED PLANS TO PLANT 4.6 MILLION TREES BY THE END OF THE DECADE, THIS PROJECT WILL ADD TENS OF THOUSANDS OF TREES TO THE GREATER HOUSTON AREA IN THE NEXT YEAR AND A HALF."}